# NFPC environment reference.
#
# Real values are never committed. Each application has its own example file
# with every variable it reads, and a comment for each:
#
#   backend/.env.example   API server: MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET, FRONTEND_URL, ...
#   frontend/.env.example  Website build: VITE_API_URL (the only browser-visible value)
#
# Copy the relevant example to .env (backend) or .env.local (frontend) and fill
# it in locally. See README.md and docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
